Hey, why is this flower that bloomed unable to cast off its sorrow?

122
00:21:23,936 --> 00:21:26,886
やすらぎをとざせるの？
Closing off tranquility?

123
00:21:27,536 --> 00:21:31,136
そしていま、そう
And now, yes...

124
00:21:31,736 --> 00:21:43,036
いとおしさをえぐり 傷にまみれた孤独 守るよ
Carving out tenderness, a lonely soul covered in wounds... I will protect you.

125
00:22:02,336 --> 00:22:08,636
ねぇ、希望なんだ
Hey, it's hope...

126
00:22:09,336 --> 00:22:15,036
せめて君の微笑みに
At least towards your smile...

127
00:22:15,936 --> 00:22:22,236
守るよ、そう、希望なんだ
I will protect you, yes, it's hope...

128
00:22:22,936 --> 00:22:29,136
せめて君の微笑みに
At least towards your smile...

129
00:22:29,936 --> 00:22:36,036
守るよ
I will protect you...

130
00:23:00,436 --> 00:23:12,236
遠くへ響き聞こえるなら 渡り鳥より導いて
If it echoes far away, guide me more than a migratory bird...

131
00:23:13,336 --> 00:23:20,036
いのちが覚えている 遥か遠く
Far away that life remembers...

132
00:23:22,336 --> 00:23:27,436
あの場所へ…
To that place...

133
00:23:28,586 --> 00:23:31,586
[Title: 美しい人]

134
00:23:38,436 --> 00:23:52,236
海鳴り ここが心がいかに囚われぬように歌って
Sing so that the roar of the sea, here in our hearts, is not imprisoned...

135
00:23:52,636 --> 00:24:03,336
あなたの生まれた言葉でメリターレ 見つめ合えばメリターレ
In the words you were born with, Melitare, if we gaze at each other, Melitare...

136
00:24:03,936 --> 00:24:11,236
瞳の中 同じ希望の光を灯してる
Lighting the same light of hope within our eyes...

137
00:24:23,936 --> 00:24:36,336
まだ見ぬ命の花は まるで鈴音の響きに西へと向う風に憧れて羽ばたいて
The flower of unseen life, like the chiming of a bell, longing for the wind heading west, spreads its wings...

138
00:24:37,036 --> 00:24:48,836
西へと向う風に憧れて羽ばたいて
Longing for the wind heading west, spreads its wings...

139
00:25:00,660 --> 00:25:06,360
手のひら重ねて 涙を
Overlapping our palms, shedding tears...

140
00:25:06,830 --> 00:25:12,160
涙を拭う 二つのことを
Wiping away tears, two things...

141
00:25:12,530 --> 00:25:24,160
教えて 二人を隔てているものは何
Tell me, what is it that separates the two of us?

142
00:25:25,330 --> 00:25:32,260
出逢いや別れが 街を彩れ
As meetings and partings color the town,

143
00:25:34,530 --> 00:25:46,360
光の中 孤独はぬくもりに溶けていく
loneliness melts into warmth within the light.

144
00:25:47,330 --> 00:25:55,560
この声が聞こえるなら 渡り鳥を導いて
If you can hear this voice, guide the migratory birds.

145
00:25:58,660 --> 00:26:10,860
霧も夜の嵐も 愛だけは阻めない
Neither fog nor night storms can block out love.

146
00:26:11,330 --> 00:26:22,160
鳥が海を渡るように 人は人を知るために
Just as birds cross the sea, humans seek to know one another...

147
00:26:23,430 --> 00:26:34,860
命が覚えている はるかなるあの場所へ
...to that distant place our lives remember.

148
00:26:47,430 --> 00:27:00,160
あなたに触れて欲しい 憧れよ 抱き寄せて
I want you to touch me; longing, pull me close.

149
00:27:08,660 --> 00:27:19,260
届いて 私の 生まれた国の言葉で
Reach me, in the language of the country where I was born.

150
00:27:20,430 --> 00:27:29,860
生まれたわ 愛している 生まれたわ
I was born, I love you, I was born.

151
00:27:32,660 --> 00:27:47,560
メルトール 愛している メルトール
Meltor, I love you, Meltor.

152
00:28:15,830 --> 00:28:20,460
この世界は 到底信じがたくて
This world is so hard to believe in,

153
00:28:20,830 --> 00:28:26,860
組み込まれた 悲劇
a built-in tragedy.

154
00:28:27,430 --> 00:28:37,160
無限連鎖で 勝ち顔を今 上書きする 錬金術のネイチャー
An infinite chain overwriting our triumphant faces now—alchemy's nature.

155
00:28:38,430 --> 00:28:47,860
ごめんね髪は 目に映らない 高速で支配し続けるならば
Sorry, if my hair keeps ruling invisibly at high speed,

156
00:28:48,330 --> 00:28:59,160
僕は 僕だけは 奇跡的で致命的なマイノリティでいい
I... I alone am fine being a miraculous and fatal minority.

157
00:29:00,430 --> 00:29:05,860
I can fly

158
00:29:07,430 --> 00:29:12,360
過去は 離れてゆくものじゃなくて
The past isn't something that drifts away,

159
00:29:12,660 --> 00:29:17,360
傷つくことの 痛みより大切な
it's more precious than the pain of getting hurt—

160
00:29:17,660 --> 00:29:22,860
真実のすべての 光が今を産む
all the light of truth gives birth to the present.

161
00:29:23,330 --> 00:29:28,360
ベイビー ドール ワンダフル ワールド
Baby doll, wonderful world...

162
00:29:41,430 --> 00:29:52,360
この命とよる 無限 まだ高くとも知らず
This life and night, infinite, still not knowing how high...

163
00:29:53,330 --> 00:30:00,860
二律背反 パラドックスさえ 限界のない
Even antinomy and paradox have no limits.

164
00:32:55,090 --> 00:32:56,590
遠い宇宙の星
A star in the distant cosmos,

165
00:32:56,590 --> 00:32:58,340
平行したまま
remaining parallel,

166
00:32:58,890 --> 00:33:04,410
同じ夜を願いながら見上げた
we looked up at the same night with our wishes.

167
00:33:05,030 --> 00:33:09,620
全てを繋ぐ線は音を立てて崩れて
The lines connecting everything collapse with a sound,

168
00:33:09,740 --> 00:33:13,640
深く交り合うほどに夜明けを望んでる
longing for dawn the more deeply we intertwine.

169
00:33:13,760 --> 00:33:16,000
道なき道をを進んでいた
Advancing down a pathless path,

170
00:33:16,230 --> 00:33:18,800
声なき声を頼りにして
relying on voiceless voices,

171
00:33:18,950 --> 00:33:20,690
名もなき歌を響かせた
letting a nameless song resonate.

172
00:33:20,870 --> 00:33:27,000
本当の祈りに今手を伸ばしてる
Now reaching out toward a true prayer...

173
00:33:28,090 --> 00:33:32,430
愚かしく美しい人生が息苦しくても
Even if this foolishly beautiful life is suffocating,

174
00:33:32,670 --> 00:33:37,520
目標は高ければ高いほど乗り越える意味があるから
the higher the goal, the more meaning there is in overcoming it.

175
00:33:37,870 --> 00:33:41,800
100万年の1でも夢が叶うなら
Even if it's a 1 in 1,000,000 chance, if our dream comes true,

176
00:33:42,170 --> 00:33:47,220
僕は何度でも何度でも戦い続けていくから
I will keep fighting over and over again.

177
00:33:47,620 --> 00:33:49,920
主役がいなきゃ始まらないよ
Without the protagonist, it won't begin.

178
00:33:49,920 --> 00:33:52,230
勝負をつけなきゃ終われないよ
Without settling the score, it can't end.

179
00:33:52,230 --> 00:33:56,660
僕と君の物語では誰も何も言えやしないよ
In the story of you and me, no one can say a thing.

180
00:33:56,980 --> 00:34:03,020
ありきたりな世界をかたやぶりな世界へ変えられる一人じゃないから
Because I'm not alone, I can change an ordinary world into an unconventional one.

181
00:34:13,640 --> 00:34:17,700
真っ直ぐな道をを進む時さえ
Even when walking down a straight path,

182
00:34:17,950 --> 00:34:23,500
不安だけは消えずに付き纏ってた
only anxiety lingered and haunted me without fading.

183
00:34:23,840 --> 00:34:28,310
いつの間にか外から心を堅く閉ざし
Before I knew it, I closed off my heart from the outside,

184
00:34:28,450 --> 00:34:31,870
自分さえも忘れて誓いを破っていた
forgetting even myself and breaking my vows.

185
00:34:32,730 --> 00:34:35,790
乾いた笑いを浮かべて
Wearing a dry smile,

186
00:34:35,920 --> 00:34:37,740
滲んだ涙を飲み干した
I drank down my blurred tears.

187
00:34:38,050 --> 00:34:44,230
歪んだ想いを伝えたいこのまま失いそうだから…
I want to convey my distorted feelings because I feel like I'm about to lose them...

188
00:34:44,600 --> 00:34:49,220
狂おしく美しい絶望に包まれても
Even if wrapped in maddeningly beautiful despair,

189
00:34:49,380 --> 00:34:54,530
未来が暗ければ暗いほど辛く迷う日もあるけど
the darker the future, the more painful and lost days there may be, but

190
00:34:54,830 --> 00:34:58,850
100億年も前から光はあるから
light has existed since 10 billion years ago, so

191
00:34:58,886 --> 00:35:00,886
僕は最後まで…
I will until the very end...

192
00:35:00,349 --> 00:35:01,549
結んで 最後まで
Tied together, all the way to the end...

193
00:35:01,549 --> 00:35:04,129
望みは捨てずにいらんんだ
...without ever giving up on our hopes.

194
00:35:04,269 --> 00:35:06,569
真実は弱く儚くて
The truth is fragile and fleeting,

195
00:35:06,569 --> 00:35:09,169
虚偽は強くむしろ蝕むの
while falsehoods are strong and corrupt us all the more.

196
00:35:09,289 --> 00:35:11,289
君と僕の結末なんて
As for the ending of you and me,

197
00:35:11,289 --> 00:35:13,889
白黒で決められないよ
we can't just decide it in black and white.

198
00:35:14,189 --> 00:35:16,589
ありふれてる奇跡や
Even ordinary miracles

199
00:35:16,589 --> 00:35:18,989
まちがけてる運命でも
or misguided fates...

200
00:35:18,989 --> 00:35:25,189
変えられない一つじゃないから
...aren't just one, so we can change them!

201
00:36:14,789 --> 00:36:16,989
一人で
Alone,

202
00:36:16,989 --> 00:36:19,389
交わして
exchanging...

203
00:36:19,389 --> 00:36:21,989
二人で
...together,

204
00:36:21,989 --> 00:36:24,189
合わせえた
matching them up.

205
00:36:24,189 --> 00:36:34,189
あの日の約束を果して...
We'll fulfill the promise we made that day...

206
00:36:37,189 --> 00:36:41,989
愚かしく麗しい人生が雪崩苦しくても
Even if an absurdly beautiful life comes crashing down in agony,

207
00:36:41,989 --> 00:36:44,789
目標は高ければ高いほど
the higher our goals are,

208
00:36:44,789 --> 00:36:47,189
乗り越える意味があるから
the more meaning there is in overcoming them!

209
00:36:47,189 --> 00:36:51,789
1000000/1でも夢が叶うなら
If a one-in-a-million dream can come true,

210
00:36:51,789 --> 00:36:56,989
僕は何度でも何度でも戦い続けていくから
I will keep on fighting, over and over again.

211
00:36:57,189 --> 00:36:59,189
主役がいなきゃ始まらないよ
Without the protagonist, nothing can begin!

212
00:36:59,189 --> 00:37:01,989
勝負をつなけきゃ終われないよ
Without settling the score, we can't end this!

213
00:37:01,989 --> 00:37:06,189
君と僕の物語には誰も何も言えやしないよ
No one can say a single thing about your and my story.

214
00:37:06,189 --> 00:37:11,989
ありきたりな世界をかたやぶりな世界へと変えられる
We can change an ordinary world into an unconventional one,

215
00:37:11,989 --> 00:37:18,189
一人じゃないから
because we are not alone!

216
00:37:34,989 --> 00:37:39,189
決められたバイナリに従います
We follow the predetermined binary,

217
00:37:39,189 --> 00:37:43,189
社会界の作法に溶け込みます
and blend into the manners of high society,

218
00:37:43,189 --> 00:37:49,189
それで価値の器が満たされると信じてた
believing that would fill our vessels of worth.

219
00:37:49,189 --> 00:37:53,189
器の下は底抜けの状態だったんだ
But the bottom of that vessel was completely hollowed out all along.

220
00:37:53,669 --> 00:37:59,969
[Title: ノミック]
[Title: Nomic]

221
00:38:01,189 --> 00:38:04,389
器を満たす為に積み重ねたものなどとに、
Things piled up to fill the vessel,

222
00:38:04,389 --> 00:38:09,989
無理きしたさんたんたる姿形と現状抱える今日に、
and today burdened with a miserable, battered shape and reality...

223
00:38:10,189 --> 00:38:17,689
してやったという優越をかけらも奴らに与えないように流れた価値を仲間と取り戻そう
Let's take back the lost value with our comrades, so we don't give those jerks even a shred of superiority of having done us a favor.

224
00:38:17,689 --> 00:38:19,189
自ら器を作っていこう
Let's craft our own vessels with our own hands!

225
00:38:19,189 --> 00:38:22,689
定石通りに動いてちゃこんな人生つまんないな
Moving strictly by the book makes life so boring, doesn't it?

226
00:38:22,689 --> 00:38:27,689
それならギアなんか壊して自分が望んだ結末をはめ込んでやれ
If so, smash the gears and force in the ending you truly desired!

227
00:38:27,689 --> 00:38:31,689
ティーカップ裏に仕込んだ情報で主役を演じていけ
Play the protagonist using the information hidden at the bottom of the teacup.

228
00:38:31,689 --> 00:38:36,689
信じたものを守り抜くことができるこの世界は私だけの人生だ
This world, where we can protect what we believe in, is my life and mine alone!

229
00:38:45,189 --> 00:38:52,189
台本通りにかけられた言葉と道行く人の思想と顔その全てが作り物であるとするならば
If the words handed down by script and the thoughts and faces of passersby are all artificial constructs...

230
00:38:52,689 --> 00:38:57,689
誰よりも強いこの意志で全て塗り替えてしまうような誰よりも強いこの意志で
...then with an iron will stronger than anyone's, like painting over it all anew, with a will stronger than anyone's...

231
00:38:57,689 --> 00:39:01,989
全て作り変えだ誰もが想像しなかった新たな未来へ
...we remade everything, heading toward a new future no one could have imagined!

232
00:40:06,034 --> 00:40:09,314
わたしだけの人生だ
It's my life and mine alone...

233
00:40:12,584 --> 00:40:16,404
決められたバイナリに抗います 社会の作法に阿んじない
Defying predetermined binaries, refusing to pander to society's ways

234
00:40:16,404 --> 00:40:19,804
それで満たされる価値があることに気付いたんだ
I realized there's value in being fulfilled by that.

235
00:40:21,294 --> 00:40:24,704
舞踏会に溢れた息苦しいスノッブリー
The suffocating snobbery overflowing the ballroom

236
00:40:24,704 --> 00:40:29,144
あり余る思惑を跳ね除け切って残ったのは人生の真の面白さだ
shaking off the excessive motives, leaving behind the true fun of life.

237
00:40:42,480 --> 00:40:48,166
[Title: POP TEAM EPIC]

238
00:41:02,820 --> 00:41:08,650
見慣れた景色に潜むイデア
Ideas lurking in familiar scenery

239
00:41:09,470 --> 00:41:14,850
いつだって君は出し抜いている
You're always a step ahead

240
00:41:16,300 --> 00:41:22,560
くるくるの髪結び合わせて
Twirling hair tied together

241
00:41:23,230 --> 00:41:28,920
回る青色のカレイドスコープ
A spinning blue kaleidoscope

242
00:41:30,300 --> 00:41:37,590
不思議な世界だ 誰も知らない空飛ぶ流星 繰返し
A mysterious world, an unknown flying meteor, repeating over and over

243
00:41:43,420 --> 00:41:49,370
思い描くピログラフ 破壊と外の幾何学模様
The pyrograph we envision, destruction and external geometric patterns

244
00:41:55,980 --> 00:42:00,520
打ち切りのドラマでまた会えるよ
We'll meet again in a canceled drama

245
00:42:02,360 --> 00:42:06,490
平行ワールド 旅して 散りばめ 寝覚めに気付いて
Traveling parallel worlds, scattering, noticing upon waking

246
00:42:16,360 --> 00:42:21,990
世界をリメイク 月日もなくて狭苦しいお庭には
Remaking the world, with no days or months, in a cramped garden

247
00:42:24,510 --> 00:42:29,620
こんなゴナにして取り換えよ
Let's make it like this and swap it out

248
00:42:30,730 --> 00:42:36,150
向から生まれ 乗り換え 連戦連勝
Born from..., transferring through consecutive victories

249
00:42:37,580 --> 00:42:43,270
昔から生まれ 乗り換え 寝覚めて
Born long ago, transferring, waking up

250
00:42:44,290 --> 00:42:49,990
何度でもディストピアを越えて
Crossing dystopia time and time again

251
00:42:54,290 --> 00:42:59,290
またお別れね 過ぎゆく世界で
Time to part ways once more in this fleeting world

252
00:43:00,166 --> 00:43:05,166
待っているから まだ眠れない
I'm waiting for you, so I still can't sleep

253
00:43:06,290 --> 00:43:10,290
満天のマンダラ 思い出も崩れてしまい
A starry mandala, even memories crumble away

254
00:43:17,290 --> 00:43:22,290
意味がない 君も忘れるだけ
It's meaningless, you'll just forget

255
00:43:23,290 --> 00:43:28,290
何度も手を振る 私たちはこりもせず
Waving our hands over and over, we never learn

256
00:43:29,290 --> 00:43:31,666
光あけるんだ
Opening up the light

257
00:44:16,290 --> 00:44:22,290
バイバイ ララバイ バイバイしちゃえば未来
Bye-bye, lullaby, once you say bye-bye, the future

258
00:44:23,290 --> 00:44:29,290
毎回 ぶれない 泣いちゃおっかなパラダイス
Every time, unshaken, shall I cry in paradise?

259
00:44:29,666 --> 00:44:35,666
バイバイ ララバイ バイバイしちゃえば未来
Bye-bye, lullaby, once you say bye-bye, the future

260
00:44:36,290 --> 00:44:42,290
絶対 帰りたい そうしなきゃ見れない
I definitely want to go back, otherwise I can't see it

261
00:44:43,290 --> 00:44:49,666
見た感情のようなさわあれ いじめて
Touch the emotions like feelings, tease them

262
00:44:50,290 --> 00:44:56,666
見ろシステムは君を箱には閉じ込めず
Look, the system won't lock you away in a box

263
00:44:56,666 --> 00:45:00,666
ゆらゆらジェンダー
Swaying gender

264
00:46:09,774 --> 00:46:19,224
ねぇねぇ二人ともダルマさんが転んだしながら、この3年間でやったことない動きしよう！
Hey hey, you two, while playing Daruma-san ga koronda, let's do movements we've never done in these 3 years!

265
00:46:19,664 --> 00:46:20,234
いいよ！
Sure!

266
00:46:20,564 --> 00:46:22,724
最初は…じゃんけんぽい！
First is... rock, paper, scissors!

267
00:46:22,724 --> 00:46:25,284
あいこでしょ！おこった！
Tie! Mad!

268
00:46:26,754 --> 00:46:30,504
行くよみんな！ダルマさんが転んだ！
Here we go everyone! Daruma-san ga koronda!

269
00:46:37,544 --> 00:46:39,764
ラミィちゃんこっち来て！お前運転して！
Lamy-chan, come over here! You drive!

270
00:46:40,304 --> 00:46:44,964
一緒にやって、おしり振るだけ。せーの、ダルマさんが転んだ！
Do it with me, just shake your hips. Ready, set, Daruma-san ga koronda!

271
00:46:45,214 --> 00:46:45,954
近い！
So close!

272
00:46:47,594 --> 00:46:49,334
あれ、ししろん本日の主役じゃん？
Wait, Shishiron is today's main character, right?

273
00:46:49,414 --> 00:46:50,404
かけつけてきた！
She rushed over!

274
00:46:50,524 --> 00:46:52,754
最初はみんな！ししろんもう一回行くよ！
First everyone! Shishiron, let's go again!

275
00:46:53,094 --> 00:46:54,884
てるーちぇっと！
Teru-chette!

276
00:46:59,624 --> 00:47:04,374
ラミィじゃんけん…じゃんけんぽい！あいこでしょ！あいこでしょ！
Lamy rock-paper-scissors... rock-paper-scissors! Tie! Tie!

277
00:47:06,114 --> 00:47:07,334
負けた！
I lost!

278
00:47:08,784 --> 00:47:11,724
